Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; EN: Undoes ajustes_ally.reg: HAGS back on (the Windows 11 default) and TdrDelay back to its default. Restart afterwards.
; ES: Deshace ajustes_ally.reg: HAGS encendido (lo normal en Windows 11) y TdrDelay a su valor por defecto. Reinicia despues.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\GraphicsDrivers]
"HwSchMode"=dword:00000002
"TdrDelay"=-
